### Rate limiter — quick manual checks (IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@clientId = alice

### Current configuration and resolved client id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rate-limit

### The protected endpoint — repeat this until it returns 429
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}

{
  "message": "hello rate limiter"
}

### Validation failure (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}

{
  "message": "   "
}

### A different client has its own budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: bob

{
  "message": "bob is not throttled by alice"
}

### What got through
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?limit=20

### Switch algorithm at runtime: FIXED_WINDOW | SLIDING_WINDOW | TOKEN_BUCKET
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rate-limit?algorithm=SLIDING_WINDOW

### Clear this client's counters in all three algorithms
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rate-limit/state?clientId={{clientId}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
